==============================================================================
Command:
bash /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/code/cortical_trajectory_analysis/registration/register_dwi_to_t1.sh D0186 /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/results/column_analysis/D0186/registration/D0186_dwi_masked.nii.gz /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/processed/t1_freesurfer /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/results/column_analysis/D0186/registration/D0186_DWI2T1.dat


==============================================================================
