==============================================================================
Command:
/home/apps/ubuntu-22.04/anaconda3/bin/python /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/code/cortical_trajectory_analysis/trajectory_processing/build_trajectories.py --subject-id D0186 --subject-dir /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/processed/t1_freesurfer/D0186 --output-dir /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/results/column_analysis/D0186/trajectories --points 21


==============================================================================
STEP 3: TRANSFORM TRAJECTORIES TO DWI SPACE
==============================================================================
Command:
/home/apps/ubuntu-22.04/anaconda3/bin/python /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/code/cortical_trajectory_analysis/trajectory_processing/transform_trajectories.py --subject-id D0186 --trajectory-dir /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/results/column_analysis/D0186/trajectories --transform /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/results/column_analysis/D0186/registration/D0186_DWI2T1.dat --dwi /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/results/column_analysis/D0186/registration/D0186_dwi_masked.nii.gz --output-dir /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/results/column_analysis/D0186/trajectories


==============================================================================
