==============================================================================
Command:
/home/apps/ubuntu-22.04/anaconda3/bin/python /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/code/cortical_trajectory_analysis/trajectory_processing/assign_regions.py --subject-id D0186 --subjects-dir /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/processed/t1_freesurfer --trajectory-dir /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/results/column_analysis/D0186/trajectories --output-dir /mnt/newStor/paros/paros_WORK/xintong/data/results/column_analysis/D0186/regions


